flowchart LR
  Src[Source code] --> Lint[Lint]
  Src --> Build[Build]
  Lint --> Test[Unit tests]
  Build --> Test
  Test --> Pkg[Package]
  Pkg --> Scan{Vulnerabilities?}
  Scan -->|none| Stage[Deploy to staging]
  Scan -->|found| Fix[Open ticket]
  Stage --> Smoke[Smoke tests]
  Smoke --> Gate{Approved?}
  Gate -->|yes| Prod([Production])
  Gate -->|no| Roll[Roll back]
